{"id":"a9536cc1c6c86510","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md","title":"ZFC Poset Complete Lattice","display":"df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice — ZFC Poset Complete Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice — ZFC Poset Complete Lattice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice — ZFC Poset Complete Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R\\in V\">\\(L,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\exists s,i\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,s\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle i,a\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall u\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\ell\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle\\ell,a\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle\\ell,i\\rangle\\in R))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\exists s,i\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,s\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle i,a\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall u\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\ell\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle\\ell,a\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle\\ell,i\\rangle\\in R))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\exists s,i\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,s\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle i,a\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall u\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall\\ell\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle\\ell,a\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle\\ell,i\\rangle\\in R))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1087,"backlinks":[{"id":"f380a2598f68e7f2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1a01a66430bb7062","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]], [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md]])"},{"id":"925a3a1f25b1a36b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (complete-lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md|58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}